	<item>
		<title><![CDATA[A Business Proposal Framework That Wins Mandates]]></title>
		<link>https://example.com/a-business-proposal-framework-that-wins-mandates/</link>
		<pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[admin]]></dc:creator>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://example.com/?p=5014</guid>
		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Open with the problem in the client's language and quantify what it costs them today.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Present two or three options with clear trade-offs, then recommend one and explain why.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Close with a fixed scope, milestones and a simple fee structure so approval is an easy yes.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

]]></content:encoded>
		<excerpt:encoded><![CDATA[Structure your proposal around the client decision, not your credentials.]]></excerpt:encoded>
